*2021 should be verified, as the dataset currently shows no toss-win-and-match-loss records.

observation:

Winning the toss appears to provide a useful advantage in successful CSK seasons.

Examples:

* 2018 converted 72.73% of toss wins into victories.
* 2023 converted 66.67% of toss wins into victories.
* 2022 and 2026 converted only 20% of toss wins into victories.

This suggests stronger CSK teams were better at capitalising on favourable match conditions after winning the toss.

conclusion:

The toss appears to influence match outcomes but is not a decisive factor on its own.

Several matches were won despite losing the toss, indicating that overall team quality remains more important than the toss result itself.
